From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:29:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] httpapi, http.sys: several URLs per group, service
 configuration, properties, file chunks, loopback only

- URL groups hold any number of URLs (invalid URL gives ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER, a duplicate
  ERROR_ALREADY_EXISTS), closing a group or session unregisters its URLs, bad group ids no longer crash;
  the todo_wine marks in tests/httpapi.c for this are removed
- HttpSet/Query/DeleteServiceConfiguration store URL ACLs, the IP listen list and the two timeouts in the
  HTTP service's registry key; HTTPS certificate bindings are not supported
- Set/Query properties of request queues, server sessions and URL groups read back what was set;
  HttpShutdownRequestQueue aborts pending receives
- response chunks may come from a file handle or the (process-local) fragment cache; HttpAddFragmentToCache,
  HttpReadFragmentFromCache, HttpFlushResponseCache
- http.sys listens on the loopback interface only (all interfaces only when 0.0.0.0 is listed in the
  service's ListenOnlyList), sends complete responses on a non-blocking socket, honours the DISCONNECT flag

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

